          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會從購物清單中移除該項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the recipe from your library and meal plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このレシピをライブラリと献立から削除します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从食谱库和周计划中移除此食谱。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會從食譜庫和週計劃中移除此食譜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces the unreadable cooking progress for this recipe. The recipe itself is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読み込めない調理進捗を置き換えます。レシピ自体は残ります。"
